ENGLISH

The source code, texts, translations, data, design and other content of this repository are the exclusive property
of the author. No licence is granted: copying, modifying, redistributing, publishing, hosting elsewhere or reusing
them, in whole or in part, for any purpose, is prohibited without the author's prior written permission.

Only viewing the repository and forking it on GitHub are permitted, to the extent GitHub's Terms of Service require
it for a public repository. This grants no right to use the content outside GitHub.

Exceptions:

- Wing plate (src/assets/wing.svg): drawing by EAnathos, licensed under Creative Commons
  Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0), https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
  Reuse is permitted for non-commercial purposes, with credit to the author. This licence does not extend to any
  other file in the repository than the head, mandible, antenna and leg plates below.

- Head plate (src/assets/head.svg): composite drawing by EAnathos, after figures 523 to 526 of Bolton (1994),
  under the same CC BY-NC 4.0 licence, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
  Reuse is permitted for non-commercial purposes, with credit to the author.

- Mandible plate (src/assets/mandible.svg): composite drawing by EAnathos, after figure 527 of Bolton (1994),
  under the same CC BY-NC 4.0 licence, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
  Reuse is permitted for non-commercial purposes, with credit to the author.

- Antenna plate (src/assets/antenna.svg): composite drawing by EAnathos, under the same CC BY-NC 4.0 licence,
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
  Reuse is permitted for non-commercial purposes, with credit to the author.

- Leg plate (src/assets/leg.svg): composite drawing by EAnathos, under the same CC BY-NC 4.0 licence,
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/
  Reuse is permitted for non-commercial purposes, with credit to the author.

- Worker plate (src/assets/ant.svg): "Scheme ant worker anatomy-clean" by LadyofHats and Sophivorus, public domain,
  https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Scheme_ant_worker_anatomy-clean.svg
  The original drawing remains in the public domain. The additions made in this repository (attributes, clickable
  areas, ommatidia grid, colour changes) are covered by the reservation of rights above.

For any permission request, open an issue with the "Permission request" form:
